  "description": "Bring warm holiday charm to your creative projects with this Festive Holiday Village Clipart Collection!\nThis bundle includes 15 beautifully illustrated Christmas village scenes, featuring snowy cottages, decorated houses, winter trees, lights, stars, and festive details — perfect for creating magical seasonal artwork.\nIdeal for crafters, designers, teachers, and anyone making Christmas-themed print or digital products.\n🖌️ Perfect For:\n🎁 Christmas cards & invitations\n🎨 Stickers, planners & scrapbooking\n🧵 Winter crafts & DIY holiday décor\n📱 Social media posts & festive graphics\n🖼️ Posters, tags & printable illustrations\n✨ Print-on-demand Christmas products\n📦 Includes:\n✅ 15 PNG Files (Transparent Background)\n✅ 15 JPG Files (High Resolution)\n✅ 15 SVG Files (Scalable Vector)\n✅ 15 EPS Files (Editable Vector)\nEach village scene captures the magic of Christmas with cozy colors, charming buildings, and winter forest elements — perfect for adding seasonal warmth to any creative project.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Bring warm holiday charm to your creative projects with this Festive Holiday Village Clipart Collection!<br>\nThis bundle includes 15 beautifully illustrated Christmas village scenes, featuring snowy cottages, decorated houses, winter trees, lights, stars, and festive details — perfect for creating magical seasonal artwork.</p>\n<p>Ideal for crafters, designers, teachers, and anyone making Christmas-themed print or digital products.</p>\n<p>🖌️ Perfect For:</p>\n<p>🎁 Christmas cards &amp; invitations<br>\n🎨 Stickers, planners &amp; scrapbooking<br>\n🧵 Winter crafts &amp; DIY holiday décor<br>\n📱 Social media posts &amp; festive graphics<br>\n🖼️ Posters, tags &amp; printable illustrations<br>\n✨ Print-on-demand Christmas products</p>\n<p>📦 Includes:</p>\n<p>✅ 15 PNG Files (Transparent Background)<br>\n✅ 15 JPG Files (High Resolution)<br>\n✅ 15 SVG Files (Scalable Vector)<br>\n✅ 15 EPS Files (Editable Vector)</p>\n<p>Each village scene captures the magic of Christmas with cozy colors, charming buildings, and winter forest elements — perfect for adding seasonal warmth to any creative project.</p>",
